    {
      "kind": "title",
      "source_text": "3人一緒にえいえい、おー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みのり、●●●●プロデューサーさん。\nなにしてるの？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それは……アイドル雑誌？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん。JIFに向けて、\n色々なライバルたちを調べてるんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "たとえば、最近このアイドルユニットが\n伸びてきてて……ここは男女混合で曲幅が広くて……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "んん？　みのりの言うこと、難しい……。\n恭二、分かる？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、俺もあまりピンとこないな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "でしたら、みんなでCDショップに\n行ってみるのはどうでしょうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいな、それ。\n実際に見聞きするのが一番わかりやすいし。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ボク、CDショップ行くの、はじめて！\n行きたい！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それじゃ、みんなで行ってみようか。\n●●●●プロデューサー、いいかい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_a:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。早速準備します！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
